# Summary

The club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The exact amount a member pays each year is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-72f1b72345ffb00a2c8bc9557f83e93e6e244647 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-6b367c92cf4813fd870ac4856338a57ac132275e "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
